1
00:02:31,017 --> 00:02:37,017
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era.

2
00:02:37,017 --> 00:02:41,017
A countless array of pirates go to battle across the seas in search of the One Piece,

3
00:02:41,017 --> 00:02:45,017
the legendary treasure left behind by Gold Roger, King of the Pirates.

4
00:02:45,017 --> 00:02:50,017
Maki D. Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber after eating the gum gum fruit,

5
00:02:50,017 --> 00:02:53,017
set sail to become the next King of the Pirates.

6
00:02:53,017 --> 00:02:56,017
As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles,

7
00:02:56,017 --> 00:02:59,017
they capture the unwanted attention of the world government,

8
00:02:59,017 --> 00:03:02,017
which will use any means necessary to stop them.

9
00:03:02,017 --> 00:03:05,017
This sight!

10
00:03:05,017 --> 00:03:08,017
Can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

11
00:03:08,017 --> 00:03:12,017
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue,

12
00:03:12,017 --> 00:03:16,017
the crew will cut a path across the Grand Line to the New World.

13
00:03:20,017 --> 00:03:24,017
Luffy fell captive to the strange net-net powers of Largo,

14
00:03:24,017 --> 00:03:26,017
the captain of the Amigo Pirate.

15
00:03:26,017 --> 00:03:33,017
While I admire your elastic nature, I'm afraid you must pay your comeuppance, senor.

16
00:03:33,017 --> 00:03:37,017
But Largo's true target was the giant beetle, Boss,

17
00:03:37,017 --> 00:03:41,017
who surrendered himself in an attempt to save his home from the pirates.

18
00:03:41,017 --> 00:03:43,017
Hold on!

19
00:03:43,017 --> 00:03:44,017
Hold on!

20
00:03:46,017 --> 00:03:48,017
I know you can hear me!

21
00:03:55,017 --> 00:04:00,017
Boss then shed his skin, destroying the nets holding Luffy and his friends.

22
00:04:00,017 --> 00:04:20,017
This is awful. It must have been too soon for him to mold.

23
00:04:20,017 --> 00:04:23,017
Your screaming and crying won't do any good.

24
00:04:23,017 --> 00:04:28,017
Good. No one's gonna save you winding peasants now that we got your guardian angel.

25
00:04:28,017 --> 00:04:29,017
The fight's not over yet.

26
00:04:29,017 --> 00:04:30,017
Okay?

27
00:04:30,017 --> 00:04:32,017
You didn't risk your life for nothing.

28
00:04:32,017 --> 00:04:34,017
We'll save your friends, Boss.

29
00:04:34,017 --> 00:04:37,017
We owe you that much. You give everything to us.

30
00:04:37,017 --> 00:04:42,017
Well, the fun's over. It's time to get serious.

31
00:04:42,017 --> 00:04:49,017
A special presentation related to the movie. The battle is on. Luffy vs. Largo.

32
00:04:49,017 --> 00:05:05,017
You're joking! You need me to spell out the odds for you?

33
00:05:05,017 --> 00:05:10,017
Three burned men and a handful of weak sea cowards with shovels and rakes.

34
00:05:10,017 --> 00:05:13,017
Do you really think you're gonna take the beetle back from us now?

35
00:05:16,017 --> 00:05:17,017
That's right.

36
00:05:17,017 --> 00:05:19,017
Now fork over Boss!

37
00:05:19,017 --> 00:05:20,017
Or else!

38
00:05:20,017 --> 00:05:21,017
We want it back!

39
00:05:29,017 --> 00:05:30,017
Thank you.

40
00:05:32,017 --> 00:05:35,017
Come on, let's see what you punks have got.

41
00:05:35,017 --> 00:05:37,017
Zoro, cut the net open.

42
00:05:37,017 --> 00:05:38,017
Sure.

43
00:05:38,017 --> 00:05:41,017
Did the beetle burn out your short-term memory?

44
00:05:41,017 --> 00:05:45,017
No matter how sharp your blades may be, they're still not strong enough to cut through my nets.

45
00:05:45,017 --> 00:05:47,017
Don't speak so soon.

46
00:05:51,017 --> 00:05:53,017
Wait for it. Lion Strike!

47
00:05:59,017 --> 00:06:01,017
We're a part of this fight too!

48
00:06:02,017 --> 00:06:03,017
Don't be stupid!

49
00:06:03,017 --> 00:06:04,017
Huh?

50
00:06:08,017 --> 00:06:09,017
Alright, second gear!

51
00:06:09,017 --> 00:06:10,017
Sanchi!

52
00:06:11,017 --> 00:06:13,017
I need a boost, you know where I'm going!

53
00:06:13,017 --> 00:06:14,017
You got it.

54
00:06:15,017 --> 00:06:17,017
Okay, net man, you're going down!

55
00:06:17,017 --> 00:06:18,017
Am I?

56
00:06:18,017 --> 00:06:19,017
Such confidence!

57
00:06:19,017 --> 00:06:21,017
Armaid's lair!

58
00:06:21,017 --> 00:06:22,017
Assault gum!

59
00:06:22,017 --> 00:06:23,017
Shoot!

60
00:06:23,017 --> 00:06:24,017
Jet bullet!

61
00:06:29,017 --> 00:06:31,017
You guys take care of the rest!

62
00:06:31,017 --> 00:06:32,017
No problem!

63
00:06:33,017 --> 00:06:35,017
Did he take out Big Bro that easy?

64
00:06:36,017 --> 00:06:38,017
No, he just caught him off guard.

65
00:06:38,017 --> 00:06:40,017
Largo's sure to beat that little punk.

66
00:06:40,017 --> 00:06:45,017
At least he better if he wants us to get in with Big Bo Shiki!

67
00:06:51,017 --> 00:06:53,017
That hurt enough for you or you want some more?

68
00:06:55,017 --> 00:06:56,017
Well, that jogged my memory.

69
00:06:57,017 --> 00:06:58,017
I know that hat of yours.

70
00:06:58,017 --> 00:07:01,017
You have a 300 million berry bounty.

71
00:07:02,017 --> 00:07:04,017
You are Monkey Diluffi, see?

72
00:07:05,017 --> 00:07:06,017
Yeah, that's me.

73
00:07:07,017 --> 00:07:10,017
It's a tragedy to end one's life at such a young age.

74
00:07:11,017 --> 00:07:15,017
But I couldn't lament your lost life compared to the loss of such a bounty.

75
00:07:16,017 --> 00:07:18,017
Mucho burning net!

76
00:07:21,017 --> 00:07:23,017
Gum gum! Jet plant!

77
00:07:23,017 --> 00:07:24,017
Ah!

78
00:07:27,017 --> 00:07:28,017
Mucho sticky net!

79
00:07:31,017 --> 00:07:32,017
This is no bueno.

80
00:07:32,017 --> 00:07:35,017
I need to find some open terrain to fight him on.

81
00:07:36,017 --> 00:07:37,017
He's running!

82
00:07:49,017 --> 00:07:51,017
Your backup's gone.

83
00:07:51,017 --> 00:07:53,017
Not surprising since they're from the East Blue.

84
00:07:54,017 --> 00:07:55,017
Guess the rumors are true.

85
00:07:55,017 --> 00:07:57,017
They don't call it the weak sea for nothing.

86
00:07:58,017 --> 00:07:59,017
No.

87
00:08:00,017 --> 00:08:02,017
They took off because it was obvious that we didn't need any backup.

88
00:08:03,017 --> 00:08:05,017
They knew two East Blue natives are more than enough.

89
00:08:06,017 --> 00:08:07,017
Slow down! Stop running!

90
00:08:08,017 --> 00:08:10,017
Take us back! We were about to kick their pirate butts!

91
00:08:11,017 --> 00:08:12,017
You sound like a damn fool!

92
00:08:13,017 --> 00:08:14,017
You can't just confront them head on like that!

93
00:08:15,017 --> 00:08:16,017
It's suicide!

94
00:08:16,017 --> 00:08:17,017
Exactly!

95
00:08:17,017 --> 00:08:18,017
You can't fight them on their own terms.

96
00:08:18,017 --> 00:08:20,017
You've got to work with your strengths if you want to win.

97
00:08:20,017 --> 00:08:21,017
Which means outsmarting them!

98
00:08:26,017 --> 00:08:27,017
Come on! We need to hurry!

99
00:08:27,017 --> 00:08:28,017
Hey!

100
00:08:28,017 --> 00:08:30,017
Don't tell me what to do, you dumb pirate!

101
00:08:30,017 --> 00:08:41,017
Listen kid, do you want them to destroy the island and take the beetle?

102
00:08:42,017 --> 00:08:44,017
You've got to trust me if you don't want them to win.

103
00:08:44,017 --> 00:08:45,017
I don't want them to win.

104
00:08:48,017 --> 00:08:49,017
Do you promise?

105
00:08:51,017 --> 00:08:55,017
If I trust you and go along with your plan, do you promise me I'll get boss back?

106
00:08:56,017 --> 00:08:57,017
Yeah.

107
00:09:03,017 --> 00:09:05,017
So, are you ready?

108
00:09:05,017 --> 00:09:06,017
Hmph.

109
00:09:07,017 --> 00:09:08,017
Well, let's do it!

110
00:09:09,017 --> 00:09:10,017
Yeah!

111
00:09:15,017 --> 00:09:17,017
You really think the two of you are enough?

112
00:09:18,017 --> 00:09:20,017
Your dilutions are as big as your mouth!

113
00:09:21,017 --> 00:09:23,017
They outnumber us, but that's all they've got.

114
00:09:24,017 --> 00:09:26,017
If you're scared, you can always sit this one out.

115
00:09:26,017 --> 00:09:29,017
First, I'm going to kick their asses, and then I'm going to kick yours.

116
00:09:32,017 --> 00:09:33,017
All right, you guys!

117
00:09:34,017 --> 00:09:35,017
Let's!

118
00:09:35,017 --> 00:09:36,017
Get those bastards!

119
00:09:37,017 --> 00:09:38,017
Die!

120
00:09:39,017 --> 00:09:40,017
What the hell?

121
00:09:41,017 --> 00:09:42,017
You mess with us and you die!

122
00:09:43,017 --> 00:09:44,017
Run, you cowards!

123
00:09:45,017 --> 00:09:47,017
We don't want you here!

124
00:09:48,017 --> 00:09:49,017
Where did they come from?

125
00:09:50,017 --> 00:09:51,017
Save that!

126
00:09:57,017 --> 00:09:59,017
Surprised to see us?

127
00:10:00,017 --> 00:10:03,017
There's a giant network of caves hidden inside the mountain back there.

128
00:10:04,017 --> 00:10:06,017
And they open up to all the different parts of the island.

129
00:10:07,017 --> 00:10:09,017
Using it as an escape route felt like kind of a waste.

130
00:10:10,017 --> 00:10:12,017
So I thought we could stage a little surprise ambush.

131
00:10:13,017 --> 00:10:15,017
Take cover, guys! We've got a storm coming!

132
00:10:17,017 --> 00:10:19,017
Now, Thunderbolt!

133
00:10:20,017 --> 00:10:21,017
Tempo!

134
00:10:21,017 --> 00:10:22,017
No!

135
00:10:26,017 --> 00:10:27,017
Okay, this is getting bad.

136
00:10:28,017 --> 00:10:29,017
Let's attack while they're still down!

137
00:10:34,017 --> 00:10:35,017
Jet!

138
00:10:38,017 --> 00:10:39,017
How the hell is this happening?

139
00:10:40,017 --> 00:10:41,017
Huh?

140
00:10:42,017 --> 00:10:43,017
Special attack, Eggstar!

141
00:10:44,017 --> 00:10:45,017
Grossy, stinky!

142
00:10:46,017 --> 00:10:47,017
Nicely done!

143
00:10:51,017 --> 00:10:52,017
Ah!

144
00:10:52,017 --> 00:10:53,017
Ah!

145
00:10:54,017 --> 00:10:55,017
Ah!

146
00:10:56,017 --> 00:10:57,017
They're awesome!

147
00:11:04,017 --> 00:11:05,017
Ah!

148
00:11:06,017 --> 00:11:07,017
No one makes a fool out of me!

149
00:11:08,017 --> 00:11:09,017
Comprende!

150
00:11:16,017 --> 00:11:17,017
What the?

151
00:11:17,017 --> 00:11:18,017
I don't know what to think here.

152
00:11:18,017 --> 00:11:20,017
I'll kill every last one of you!

153
00:11:21,017 --> 00:11:22,017
No!

154
00:11:23,017 --> 00:11:24,017
Huh?

155
00:11:29,017 --> 00:11:30,017
Bug?

156
00:11:31,017 --> 00:11:33,017
Die, you damn bug!

157
00:11:37,017 --> 00:11:38,017
Out of ammo?

158
00:11:38,017 --> 00:11:48,017
What have you done to me, hermano?

159
00:11:49,017 --> 00:11:51,017
As a requiem for my beloved kin.

160
00:11:52,017 --> 00:11:53,017
I'll kill your crew.

161
00:11:54,017 --> 00:11:55,017
Captain first!

162
00:11:56,017 --> 00:12:00,017
Now that we've traded the confines of the jungle for open spaces, you'll surely perish!

163
00:12:00,017 --> 00:12:01,017
Oh yeah?

164
00:12:01,017 --> 00:12:03,017
I'm pretty sure I can kick your ass anywhere!

165
00:12:04,017 --> 00:12:05,017
Bring it!

166
00:12:05,017 --> 00:12:06,017
Your blood with arrogance!

167
00:12:07,017 --> 00:12:08,017
Show me your best, senor!

168
00:12:09,017 --> 00:12:10,017
Ah!

169
00:12:14,017 --> 00:12:15,017
Hm?

170
00:12:15,017 --> 00:12:16,017
What's that all about?

171
00:12:16,017 --> 00:12:17,017
It's filthy!

172
00:12:17,017 --> 00:12:18,017
He seems to be engaged in battle.

173
00:12:19,017 --> 00:12:20,017
Jet!

174
00:12:21,017 --> 00:12:22,017
Ha-zah!

175
00:12:23,017 --> 00:12:24,017
No shock!

176
00:12:24,017 --> 00:12:25,017
Net body!

177
00:12:26,017 --> 00:12:27,017
What's that?

178
00:12:27,017 --> 00:12:30,017
I hate to tell you, but you can't hurt me now!

179
00:12:30,017 --> 00:12:31,017
He-he-he!

180
00:12:32,017 --> 00:12:33,017
Dom-Dom-Jet!

181
00:12:34,017 --> 00:12:35,017
Tell me!

182
00:12:40,017 --> 00:12:41,017
It's not worth it!

183
00:12:42,017 --> 00:12:43,017
How long do you plan to keep it up?

184
00:12:44,017 --> 00:12:46,017
How long till I knock you on your ass?!

185
00:12:46,017 --> 00:12:48,017
This guy must have a devil fruit power!

186
00:12:49,017 --> 00:12:50,017
He's not getting hurt!

187
00:12:50,017 --> 00:12:51,017
Well that can't be good.

188
00:12:51,017 --> 00:12:52,017
No!

189
00:12:58,017 --> 00:12:59,017
Quit prolonging the inevitable!

190
00:13:00,017 --> 00:13:01,017
For me, hermano!

191
00:13:02,017 --> 00:13:04,017
I will make your death cry his funeral day!

192
00:13:05,017 --> 00:13:06,017
Mucho, mucho!

193
00:13:07,017 --> 00:13:09,017
Full Net Body!

194
00:13:14,017 --> 00:13:15,017
Lupin, no!

195
00:13:15,017 --> 00:13:16,017
What happened?

196
00:13:21,017 --> 00:13:26,017
There is no escape from retribution now!

197
00:13:27,017 --> 00:13:30,017
Struggle all you like, but you will never break this net!

198
00:13:36,017 --> 00:13:37,017
What the what?

199
00:13:41,017 --> 00:13:43,017
Looks like a submersible vessel of some sort.

200
00:13:43,017 --> 00:13:46,017
Wait, don't tell me they're using it as a pirate ship!

201
00:13:46,017 --> 00:13:47,017
So it would seem.

202
00:13:48,017 --> 00:13:51,017
How sweet it will be when I trade in your corpse for 300 million berries!

203
00:13:52,017 --> 00:13:53,017
Third gear!

204
00:13:53,017 --> 00:13:54,017
Huh?

205
00:13:54,017 --> 00:13:55,017
Bone Balloon!

206
00:13:55,017 --> 00:13:56,017
Huh?

207
00:13:57,017 --> 00:13:58,017
Hey!

208
00:13:58,017 --> 00:13:59,017
What's that?

209
00:14:03,017 --> 00:14:04,017
Ah!

210
00:14:05,017 --> 00:14:06,017
Please stop!

211
00:14:06,017 --> 00:14:07,017
GANF!

212
00:14:33,017 --> 00:14:34,017
GUM GUM!

213
00:14:34,017 --> 00:14:35,217
Bryant...

214
00:14:35,217 --> 00:14:37,757
...pictop!

215
00:14:37,757 --> 00:14:41,857
So you are more realistic than you.

216
00:14:41,857 --> 00:14:43,337
Book!

217
00:14:43,337 --> 00:14:48,037
You don't!

218
00:15:02,657 --> 00:15:04,677
Yikes.

219
00:15:04,677 --> 00:15:06,877
Give me the boy!

220
00:15:06,877 --> 00:15:10,877
I'm coming to your rescue, Levine!

221
00:15:10,877 --> 00:15:11,877
I gotcha!

222
00:15:15,877 --> 00:15:17,877
Oh, I forgot that I'm unable to swim.

223
00:15:21,877 --> 00:15:24,877
I feared I was slipping over the brink of dash.

224
00:15:24,877 --> 00:15:27,877
So in my case, the implications of that are rather vague.

225
00:15:30,877 --> 00:15:33,877
Thanks, big guy. I owe you one.

226
00:15:33,877 --> 00:15:38,877
Oh, jeez! What was that for?

227
00:15:41,877 --> 00:15:44,877
You cheater! You could barely shoot fire a few minutes ago!

228
00:15:44,877 --> 00:15:48,877
All right, that's it! Our fight starts right now!

229
00:15:48,877 --> 00:15:51,877
I would appreciate it if you'd put me down first.

230
00:15:51,877 --> 00:15:52,877
Hurry!

231
00:15:52,877 --> 00:15:53,877
Whoa!

232
00:15:53,877 --> 00:16:04,877
They're still going.

233
00:16:04,877 --> 00:16:07,877
I'm starting to think this fight will never end.

234
00:16:07,877 --> 00:16:09,877
Yeah.

235
00:16:09,877 --> 00:16:10,877
Yeah.

236
00:16:10,877 --> 00:16:12,877
Okay, round three!

237
00:16:23,877 --> 00:16:24,877
Miss you, Dad.

238
00:16:26,877 --> 00:16:27,877
Hey, there you are.

239
00:16:29,877 --> 00:16:30,877
Mind if I sit?

240
00:16:30,877 --> 00:16:33,877
What are you doing here?

241
00:16:33,877 --> 00:16:35,877
I heard there was an orange plantation.

242
00:16:35,877 --> 00:16:36,877
Thought I'd check it out.

243
00:16:38,877 --> 00:16:40,877
What an incredible view.

244
00:16:46,877 --> 00:16:50,877
You know, my dad used to come out here all the time.

245
00:16:50,877 --> 00:16:53,877
We both did.

246
00:16:56,877 --> 00:16:57,877
Isn't the view just lovely?

247
00:16:57,877 --> 00:17:00,877
There's simply no place in the world I like better than this one.

248
00:17:01,877 --> 00:17:02,877
Yeah!

249
00:17:02,877 --> 00:17:03,877
It's so pretty!

250
00:17:03,877 --> 00:17:04,877
I love it up here!

251
00:17:05,877 --> 00:17:07,877
I really, really, really love it!

252
00:17:08,877 --> 00:17:09,877
Well, I believe it.

253
00:17:09,877 --> 00:17:13,877
Let's burn it down!

254
00:17:13,877 --> 00:17:17,877
Gather up any food and valuables who can kill anyone who tries to get in our way!

255
00:17:18,877 --> 00:17:19,877
Dad!

256
00:17:19,877 --> 00:17:20,877
Wake up!

257
00:17:21,877 --> 00:17:22,877
Yoko.

258
00:17:23,877 --> 00:17:24,877
Hurry.

259
00:17:25,877 --> 00:17:27,877
You must leave the island.

260
00:17:27,877 --> 00:17:28,877
No way!

261
00:17:28,877 --> 00:17:29,877
I can't!

262
00:17:29,877 --> 00:17:31,877
I love it here too much to go!

263
00:17:31,877 --> 00:17:35,877
If I leave, I'll never be able to visit my favorite place in the world again!

264
00:17:35,877 --> 00:17:38,877
It's your favorite place too, remember?

265
00:17:38,877 --> 00:17:40,877
With all the orange trees!

266
00:17:46,877 --> 00:17:47,877
You're right, Yoko.

267
00:17:59,877 --> 00:18:00,877
From now on...

268
00:18:02,877 --> 00:18:03,877
It's your island.

269
00:18:05,877 --> 00:18:06,877
No!

270
00:18:06,877 --> 00:18:07,877
Dad!

271
00:18:09,877 --> 00:18:11,877
Protect your home.

272
00:18:11,877 --> 00:18:12,877
Be strong.

273
00:18:13,877 --> 00:18:14,877
And brave.

274
00:18:21,877 --> 00:18:22,877
We're a lot alike.

275
00:18:22,877 --> 00:18:23,877
Huh?

276
00:18:23,877 --> 00:18:26,877
I used to hate pirates just as much as you.

277
00:18:26,877 --> 00:18:27,877
